    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The melody you play moves the world \u2014 experience a brand-new kind of musical 3D platforming action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump and every dash causes the melody to shift up or down in pitch, allowing you to improvise your own music while navigating each stage. Experience the thrill of controlling the melody at your own pace as you create a unique game soundtrack in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous melody-based mechanics add to the excitement. Platforms that rise and fall in sync with your pitch, rhythm-activated mechanisms, and other dynamic elements create a seamless fusion of sound and action that's truly addictive. The background visuals and BGM synchronize with the music you create, transforming each stage into a &quot;living score&quot; that evolves dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run freely to the rhythm, immerse yourself in the perfect blend of musical expression and fluid gameplay, and enjoy an entirely new play experience. Now, it's your turn to move the world with your sound. Step into the ever-expanding world of <i>MeloMisterio</i> and embark on a thrilling musical adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The melody you play moves the world \u2014 experience a brand-new kind of musical 3D platforming action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump and every dash causes the melody to shift up or down in pitch, allowing you to improvise your own music while navigating each stage. Experience the thrill of controlling the melody at your own pace as you create a unique game soundtrack in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous melody-based mechanics add to the excitement. Platforms that rise and fall in sync with your pitch, rhythm-activated mechanisms, and other dynamic elements create a seamless fusion of sound and action that's truly addictive. The background visuals and BGM synchronize with the music you create, transforming each stage into a &quot;living score&quot; that evolves dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run freely to the rhythm, immerse yourself in the perfect blend of musical expression and fluid gameplay, and enjoy an entirely new play experience. Now, it's your turn to move the world with your sound. Step into the ever-expanding world of <i>MeloMisterio</i> and embark on a thrilling musical adventure!</p>",
